仔<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/an-ne.html\" target=\"_blank\">Án-ne上好</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">1</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">郭于中<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/blog-post_5.html\" target=\"_blank\">媽媽親像天</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>2</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">何明洲<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/siann.html\" target=\"_blank\">Siânn囡仔睏</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>3</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳昭蓉<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/blog-post_6.html\" target=\"_blank\">高血壓</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>3</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蘇晏德<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/peng.html\" target=\"_blank\">地牛péng花蓮</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>45</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">來唸七字仔</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">楊忠憲<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/blog-post_71.html\" target=\"_blank\">結婚講好話（五）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>5</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">楊喜媛 Iûnn Hí-uân<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/blog-post_0.html\" target=\"_blank\">來讀冊</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>5</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿瑞--ā話仙</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/blog-post_19.html\" target=\"_blank\">山豬湖看火金蛄</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>7</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／黃建龍</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／蔡天享<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/tui_6.html\" target=\"_blank\">Tuì紀念湯德章律師對照西班牙</a></span><span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/tui_6.html\" target=\"_blank\">轉型正義之路</a></span><br /></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">8</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">光景bóng uē</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">許愈琳<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/e_11.html\" target=\"_blank\">記持中ê檨仔跤</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>10</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">鄭浩成<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/e_51.html\" target=\"_blank\">天使ê目屎——嘉明湖</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>12</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心內話</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">劉靜媛<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/tshua.html\" target=\"_blank\">一隻貓仔tshuā我沓沓仔行</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">15</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">劉芯瑀 Lâu Sim-ú<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/ti.html\" target=\"_blank\">行tī台語路求進步</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">17</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">郤佳源<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/tshuae.html\" target=\"_blank\">Tshuā後母班ê心情</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">19</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">醫學台文</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">羅九安<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/beh-tioh-ah-lah.html\" target=\"_blank\">想beh避免失智症，</a></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/beh-tioh-ah-lah.html\" target=\"_blank\">骨力運動就tio̍h--ah--lah！</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">21</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">地名研究室</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">黃偉嘉<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/blog-post_12.html\" target=\"_blank\">『砂卡礑』</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">24</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán來講看māi</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>Marwin</i><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/suann-ling-pootsit.html\" target=\"_blank\">「Suann-lîng-poo」tsit个地號名</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>25</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張耀仁<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/uie.html\" target=\"_blank\">Uì台語聲韻體會宋詞ê音樂性</a></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/uie.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">——用李清照《聲聲慢》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">做例</span></a></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">28</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tiuⁿ Bín-hâm<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/ho-ko-hiong-chhi-tiu-peh-e-phoe.html\" target=\"_blank\">Hō͘ Ko-hiông Chhī-tiúⁿ A-peh ê Phoe</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/ho-ko-hiong-chhi-tiu-peh-e-phoe.html\" target=\"_blank\">Hō͘高雄市長阿伯ê批</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">43<br /><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣人寫真</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">許惠婷<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/kah-in.html\" target=\"_blank\">阿英kah in阿母</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>32</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蕭立慧<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/esap-bun.html\" target=\"_blank\">阿母ê手工sap-bûn</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>33</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">徐婷瑩 Tshî Tîng-îng<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/e_12.html\" target=\"_blank\">石垣島ê東さん</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>34</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">生活ê藝術</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張寶明<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/e_44.html\" target=\"_blank\">早頓ê引誘魅力</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>36</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">黃明勝<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/katsiann.html\" target=\"_blank\">Kā坎坷tsiânn做力量</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>37</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sann-kap讀小說</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雁&nbsp; &nbsp; 翎<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/be.html\" target=\"_blank\">符仔籙（三）：Bē生牽拖厝邊</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>39</span></div></div></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div></div><div><span><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjT29KKX_W8PyLBJ_nNXP_wQNNhwKVtI8-IxWLbOHjq7-5ORl7kqPl1dh9IrhGF4wN0gx8oISXOJ0If0PIvS5kY7Ngv_vHl6mY6lki7cLIDAS-7Mv6QsdSyw_gcaHJRxfEzHHyLmgO9sWbQQlCN_csqRxJKmy0lZWsAtGCfk1JCbaslyRg5NHnV7cC6qQr-/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-origin